const tr=(e,t)=>globalThis.I18n.t(e,t);async function addBookmark(e,t,d){return t?"#"===globalThis.AppUtils.safeUrl(t)?alert(tr("add.onlyHttp")):await globalThis.db.addBookmark({title:e||t,url:t,folderId:d||"1",added:Date.now()}):alert(tr("add.urlRequired"))}async function loadFoldersIntoSelect(){let e=document.getElementById("folder-select");if(e)for(let t of(e.innerHTML="",await globalThis.db.getFolders()||[{id:"1",name:tr("common.defaultFolder")}])){let d=document.createElement("option");d.value=t.id,d.textContent=t.name,e.appendChild(d)}}function showStatus(e,t=2500){let d=document.getElementById("status");d&&(d.textContent=e,setTimeout(()=>{d.textContent===e&&(d.textContent="")},t))}document.getElementById("add-bookmark").addEventListener("click",()=>{let e=document.getElementById("title").value,t=document.getElementById("url").value,d=document.getElementById("add-bookmark");d.disabled=!0,addBookmark(e,t,document.getElementById("folder-select")?.value).then(()=>{showStatus(tr("add.bookmarkAdded")),document.getElementById("title").value="",document.getElementById("url").value=""}).catch(e=>console.warn("Add failed",e)).finally(()=>{d.disabled=!1})}),document.getElementById("open-view")?.addEventListener("click",()=>{chrome.tabs.create({url:chrome.runtime.getURL("pages/view/view.html")})}),document.getElementById("open-history-viewer")?.addEventListener("click",async()=>{chrome.tabs.create({url:chrome.runtime.getURL("pages/history/history.html")})}),loadFoldersIntoSelect().catch(()=>{});